id: neko-majin-dama-fourth-effect
name: 4th effect of Neko Majin-Dama
type: instant
actionCost: 0
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/round
fromTrait: neko-majin-dama
fromEffect: 4
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Neko Majin-Dama's fourth effect, as a Maneuver: an Instant, 1 Action - an Integrated Majin-Dama expelled, dropped or Equipped.
text: >
  (4)-[1/Round]: As an Instant Maneuver, you can spend 1 Action to expel an Integrated Majin-Dama from your body. When you do, it stops being Integrated and is dropped or Equipped (your choice).

---

# Owned by every character, listed while Neko Majin-Dama is had (`fromTrait`). An Instant costs no Action of its own: its
# 1 Action paid as it is expelled - a Standard one on your turn, a Counter one off it. Refused with none Integrated or no
# Action left (majin-dama.mjs whyNotMajinDama); which, and dropped or Equipped, asked (majin-dama.mjs expelMajinDama).
[on used]
expelMajinDama();
